## Architecture Layers Summary

| Layer | Components | Purpose |
|-------|------------|---------|
| **Presentation** | Flutter Mobile, Flutter Web, WordPress, Admin, Owner, API Consumers | User-facing applications |
| **API** | REST API, Auth, AuthZ, Validation, Rate Limiting | Request handling |
| **Runtime** | Engine, Bootstrap, EventBus, Repository, Search, Sync, Scheduler | Platform orchestration |
| **Commercial Aggregate** | Business, Accommodation, Availability, Reservation, Visitor, Payment, Notification | Core business domain |
| **Platform Capabilities** | Identity, Destination, Community, Engagement, SaaS, etc. | Platform services |
| **Ecosystem** | Exploration, Governance, Operations | Extended ecosystem |
| **Core** | Persistence, Core, Tenant | Foundation capabilities |
| **Repository** | Engine, Factory, Adapters, Mixins | Data persistence abstraction |
| **Infrastructure** | PostgreSQL, Drizzle, WordPress, JWT, Providers | External systems |

## Relationship Types

| Type | Symbol | Description |
|------|--------|-------------|
| **Uses** | ────▶ | Direct dependency |
| **Delegates** | ────▶ | Manager → Capability |
| **Publishes** | ──▶ | Event emission |
| **Subscribes** | ◀─── | Event consumption |
| **Persists** | ────▶ | Repository access |
| **Orchestrates** | ────▶ | Runtime coordination |
| **Forbidden** | -x | No direct import |

## Design Freeze P13.8

The Commercial Aggregate (Business, Accommodation, Availability, Reservation, Visitor, Payment, Notification) is **frozen** as of P13.8. No modifications to aggregate ownership, business orchestration patterns, or domain boundaries are permitted.

